{"version":1,"content":"<p>相信不少人都試過飯後感到眼睏，更習慣立即喝一杯提神咖啡，好讓有足夠精神應付剩餘工作。</p><p>但近期卻有專家指出補充蛋白質，其實比起咖啡更具有提振精神的效果，不但能補充營養，還有助穩定血糖。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;日本職業醫學專科</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.026118+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"915c65cd3203f2248f806b6b08ece705b1e29cc2fd1139b97e76fccdb1b9cbee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}